    <section class="login-form-area"><div class="login-card"><span class="login-symbol"><GraduationCap :size="24" /></span><div class="form-eyebrow">WELCOME TO YOUR LEARNING SPACE</div><h2>欢迎回到学习空间</h2><p class="form-description">登录后，继续你的下一次技能探索。</p><form @submit.prevent="onSubmit"><p v-if="error" class="error" role="alert">{{ error }}</p><label for="username">用户名<input id="username" v-model="username" type="text" autocomplete="username" placeholder="请输入你的用户名" required /></label><label for="password">密码<input id="password" v-model="password" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" placeholder="请输入密码" required /></label><button type="submit" :disabled="busy" class="login-btn" aria-label="登录" data-testid="login-submit">{{ busy ? '正在登录…' : '进入学习空间' }}<ArrowRight :size="16" /></button></form><p class="account-hint"><LockKeyhole :size="14" />教师与学员均可登录，账号由管理员开通。</p></div><footer>工序智传 · 智能技能教育<a href="/open-source.txt" target="_blank" rel="noopener">开源与许可</a></footer></section>
